      "date": "2026-02-23",
      "description": "Reduce charge times at all charges: Charge 1: 4d 12h -> 3d Time Charge 2: 6d 12h -> 4d 12h Time Reduce charge costs at all charges: Charge 1: 10,000,000 -> 7,000,000 Gold Charge 2: 6,250,000 -> 4,000,000 Gold"
