    {
      "date": "2026-04-27",
      "description": "Added the level 13 X-Bow. X-Bow13 Ground X-Bow13 Air Removed the Supercharges at level 12 Icon Supercharge ⚡ Reduced upgrade times at levels 4 to 7, and 12: Level 4: 3d -> 2d 12h Time Level 5: 3d 12h -> 3d Time Level 6: 4d -> 3d 12h Time Level 7: 4d 6h -> 4d Time Level 12: 10d 12h -> 8d Time"
